 * FAQItem — a React-style component factory for disclosure widgets.
 *
 * Renders into a pre-existing `.example` element that must already
 * contain a <button class="faq-trigger"> and a <div class="details">.
 *
 * Manages: aria-expanded on the trigger, aria-hidden on the panel,
 * and keyboard handling (Escape to close).
